<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>Vinofilo</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/</link><description>Vinofilo：意大利葡萄酒的故事、产区与工艺。品种、产区、酿造与侍酒，有观点地讲述。</description><language>zh</language><atom:link href="https://vinofilo.com/zh/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Morellino di Scansano：望向大海的桑娇维塞</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.25/morellino-di-scansano-sangjiaoweisai-maleima/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.25/morellino-di-scansano-sangjiaoweisai-maleima/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>从沼泽到葡萄园。2007年起成为DOCG的Morellino di Scansano，讲述了一个被重新塑造的马雷玛：排干沼泽、土地改革与阳光充沛的桑娇维塞。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/morellino-di-scansano.jpg?v=e4615d8f" length="305391" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/morellino-di-scansano.jpg?v=e4615d8f" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>勃艮第分级详解：从大区级到特级园，一次读懂</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.25/bogendi-fenji-texiyuan-yijiyuan/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.25/bogendi-fenji-texiyuan-yijiyuan/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>大区级、村庄级、一级园、特级园，以及2015年列入联合国教科文组织名录的climats。如何读懂勃艮第，从夜丘到伯恩丘。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/borgogna-crus-spiegati.jpg?v=2e288a4e" length="356090" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/borgogna-crus-spiegati.jpg?v=2e288a4e" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>葡萄酒多少度？红葡萄酒、白葡萄酒、波特、圣酒与热红酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.25/putaojiu-duoshao-du/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.25/putaojiu-duoshao-du/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>从5.5度的阿斯蒂莫斯卡托到19度以上的波特酒：红、白、起泡、甜酒和加强酒各有多少酒精，以及如何读懂酒标上的度数。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/quanti-gradi-ha-il-vino.jpg?v=8860fd3c" length="258452" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/quanti-gradi-ha-il-vino.jpg?v=8860fd3c" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>出酒、苹果酸乳酸发酵与换桶：采收之后的酒窖</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.24/chujiu-pingguosuan-rusuan-fajiao-huantong/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.24/chujiu-pingguosuan-rusuan-fajiao-huantong/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>采收结束，酒还没准备好。出酒、压榨、苹果酸乳酸发酵和换桶一一解释，以及为什么十一月是酒窖里的静默之月。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/svinatura-e-malolattica.jpg?v=89d23562" length="141234" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/svinatura-e-malolattica.jpg?v=89d23562" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>普里米蒂沃与仙粉黛：同一种葡萄，两本护照</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.24/pulimidiwo-xianfendai-tongyi-zhong-putao/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.24/pulimidiwo-xianfendai-tongyi-zhong-putao/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>相同的DNA，两段历史。达尔马提亚葡萄Tribidrag如何在加州成为仙粉黛（Zinfandel），在普利亚成为普里米蒂沃（Primitivo），以及为什么两种酒并不相像。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/primitivo-e-zinfandel.jpg?v=86b52051" length="376142" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/primitivo-e-zinfandel.jpg?v=86b52051" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Roero Arneis：差点消失的任性白葡萄</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.23/roero-arneis-luoaile-baiputao/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.23/roero-arneis-luoaile-baiputao/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>七十年代只有两家在酿它。如今阿内斯（Arneis）是罗埃罗的象征，那是一片沙质土地，出产一种不同于朗格的内比奥罗。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/roero-arneis.jpg?v=7768f9ef" length="286891" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/roero-arneis.jpg?v=7768f9ef" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>酒农香槟：小种植者掀起的香槟革命</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.23/jiunong-xiangbin-grower-champagne/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.23/jiunong-xiangbin-grower-champagne/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>酒标上的缩写、Anselme Selosse，以及“地块对抗调配”的赌注。什么是酒农香槟（grower Champagne），它们又为何改变了整个香槟产区。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/champagne-dei-vignerons.jpg?v=235bacbf" length="339977" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/champagne-dei-vignerons.jpg?v=235bacbf" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>调Spritz用哪款普罗塞克：Brut还是Extra Dry，以及其他选择</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.23/tiaozhi-spritz-yong-naxie-prosecco/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.23/tiaozhi-spritz-yong-naxie-prosecco/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>Brut还是Extra Dry，DOC还是DOCG，换成别的起泡酒行不行：调Spritz该选哪款普罗塞克、官方配方，以及为什么酒很重要。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/prosecco-per-lo-spritz.jpg?v=604a6f46" length="339856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/prosecco-per-lo-spritz.jpg?v=604a6f46" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>热蘸酱配什么酒：皮埃蒙特十一月的Bagna cauda仪式</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.22/bagna-cauda-pei-shenme-jiu-piemengte/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.22/bagna-cauda-pei-shenme-jiu-piemengte/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>大蒜、凤尾鱼、橄榄油和用来蘸食的蔬菜。巴贝拉、Freisa、多姿桃，还是一款有结构的白葡萄酒？如何为bagna cauda挑选合适的葡萄酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-la-bagna-cauda.jpg?v=d3ac9da1" length="289744" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-la-bagna-cauda.jpg?v=d3ac9da1" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>2026年全球葡萄酒：葡萄园更少，饮酒者更少，王者依旧</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.22/2026-quanqiu-putaojiu-chanliang-xiaofei/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.22/2026-quanqiu-putaojiu-chanliang-xiaofei/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>根据OIV数据看全球葡萄酒产量、消费量与种植面积：世界为何酿得更少、喝得更少，在等待2026年估算之际，意大利、法国和西班牙处在什么位置。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/produzione-mondiale-vino-2026.jpg?v=8ae1dea0" length="403409" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/produzione-mondiale-vino-2026.jpg?v=8ae1dea0" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>加蒂纳拉与盖梅：被二十世纪遗忘的内比奥罗</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.21/jiadinala-gaimei-shang-piemengte-neibiaoluo/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.21/jiadinala-gaimei-shang-piemengte-neibiaoluo/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Spanna、火山岩与蒙特罗莎山脚下的两个DOCG。上皮埃蒙特内比奥罗的历史、衰落与复兴，从加蒂纳拉（Gattinara）到盖梅（Ghemme）。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/gattinara-e-ghemme.jpg?v=01132208" length="299448" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/gattinara-e-ghemme.jpg?v=01132208" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>感恩节配什么葡萄酒：美国最难搭配的一桌菜</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.21/ganenjie-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.21/ganenjie-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>火鸡、填馅、蔓越莓、甜薯和南瓜派一起上桌。从俄勒冈到意大利，哪些葡萄酒能撑住感恩节晚餐？一份实用的配酒指南。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-per-thanksgiving.jpg?v=a7e6d563" length="403463" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-per-thanksgiving.jpg?v=a7e6d563" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Vin Santo，在等待中酿成的酒：风干、caratelli与madre</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.20/vin-santo-tuoskanana-fenggan-caratelli/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.20/vin-santo-tuoskanana-fenggan-caratelli/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>风干、caratelli小橡木桶与madre酒母：托斯卡纳Vin Santo如何诞生，特伦蒂诺和翁布里亚有何不同，以及为什么配cantucci并不是唯一答案。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vin-santo-caratelli-e-pazienza.jpg?v=4dc43576" length="361696" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vin-santo-caratelli-e-pazienza.jpg?v=4dc43576" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>tortellini清汤配什么酒（兼谈cappelletti与anolini）</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.20/tortellini-qingtang-pei-shenme-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.20/tortellini-qingtang-pei-shenme-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>清汤、馅料面食与圣诞的合适之酒。为什么液体要配液体，以及何时选Lambrusco、Pignoletto、Albana或Sangiovese。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-i-tortellini-in-brodo.jpg?v=c619eb9b" length="264525" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-i-tortellini-in-brodo.jpg?v=c619eb9b" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>为什么葡萄酒不一定是纯素的：鸡蛋、牛奶和鱼胶</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.20/putaojiu-shi-sushi-ma-chengqing/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.20/putaojiu-shi-sushi-ma-chengqing/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>下胶澄清会用到蛋清、酪蛋白、明胶或鱼胶，它们几乎不会留在酒里。为什么葡萄酒不一定是纯素的，酒标又会告诉你什么。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-vegano-chiarifica.jpg?v=ed60a3b1" length="289293" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-vegano-chiarifica.jpg?v=ed60a3b1" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>圣诞节该喝什么酒：按菜、按产区的搭配指南</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.19/shengdanjie-yidali-putaojiu-dapei/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.19/shengdanjie-yidali-putaojiu-dapei/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>从tortellini清汤到abbacchio烤羊羔，从cardone到家传甜点：依意大利各地传统，为12月25日的午餐挑选合适的酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vini-per-natale.jpg?v=884ab7bf" length="230838" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vini-per-natale.jpg?v=884ab7bf" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>玉米糊配什么酒？要看上面放了什么</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.19/yumihu-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.19/yumihu-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>塔拉尼亚、康恰、鳕鱼干、蘑菇、炖肉。玉米糊是一块白画布，酒要按浇头来选。阿尔卑斯山区与山麓地带的葡萄酒指南。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-la-polenta.jpg?v=f9b43831" length="328103" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-la-polenta.jpg?v=f9b43831" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>火鸡与阉鸡配什么酒？从清汤到填馅</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.18/huoji-yanji-pei-shenme-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.18/huoji-yanji-pei-shenme-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>水煮阉鸡、填馅阉鸡、烤火鸡：在清淡红酒、有结构的白酒和桃红之间，逐道菜挑选适合圣诞与感恩节的酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-tacchino-e-cappone.jpg?v=1574cd75" length="278564" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-tacchino-e-cappone.jpg?v=1574cd75" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Magnum及更大：为什么酒瓶从来不只是个容器</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.18/magnum-jiuping-guige-pingxing/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.18/magnum-jiuping-guige-pingxing/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>为什么是750毫升，Magnum大瓶装里发生了什么变化，以及如何看懂超大规格和瓶型，从波尔多瓶到阿尔巴瓶。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/formati-bottiglia-magnum-e-oltre.jpg?v=bc2e5ff3" length="257538" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/formati-bottiglia-magnum-e-oltre.jpg?v=bc2e5ff3" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>为什么叫Est Est Est？蒙特菲亚斯科内的主教之酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.18/est-est-est-montefiascone-chuanshuo/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.18/est-est-est-montefiascone-chuanshuo/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>仆人马蒂诺与德富克主教的传说、圣弗拉维亚诺教堂里的墓，以及Est! Est!! Est!!! di Montefiascone DOC杯中真正的模样。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/est-est-est-montefiascone.jpg?v=10e890e0" length="272898" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/est-est-est-montefiascone.jpg?v=10e890e0" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>潘妮托尼与潘多洛配什么酒？别再开Brut了</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.17/panettone-pandoro-pei-shenme-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.17/panettone-pandoro-pei-shenme-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>为什么干型起泡酒配不了意大利圣诞蛋糕，以及真正该选哪些酒：Moscato d’Asti、风干甜酒、Recioto与Brachetto。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-panettone-e-pandoro.jpg?v=70649df8" length="248368" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-panettone-e-pandoro.jpg?v=70649df8" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>真正酿过酒的女人们：从凯歌夫人到首位葡萄酒大师</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.17/nuren-niang-putaojiu-lishi/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.17/nuren-niang-putaojiu-lishi/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>从凯歌寡妇到莉莉·宝林爵，从“葡萄酒女性”协会到首位女性葡萄酒大师：这些有据可查的故事，讲的是不请自来、改变了葡萄酒的人。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/donne-che-hanno-fatto-il-vino.jpg?v=ea59fe6c" length="217200" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/donne-che-hanno-fatto-il-vino.jpg?v=ea59fe6c" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>平安夜海鲜大餐配什么酒：从baccalà到capitone</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.16/pingan-ye-haixian-dacan-pei-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.16/pingan-ye-haixian-dacan-pei-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>咸鳕鱼、鳗鱼、炸海鲜、生鱼和vongole意面。平安夜无肉晚宴的酒食搭配指南，逐个产区讲起。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-cenone-vigilia-pesce.jpg?v=492d6030" length="418917" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-cenone-vigilia-pesce.jpg?v=492d6030" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>两千年前的罗马人怎么喝酒：兑水、蜂蜜、松脂与Falerno</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.16/gu-luoma-hejiu-shui-fengmi-falerno/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.16/gu-luoma-hejiu-shui-fengmi-falerno/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>古罗马人如何喝酒：Falerno、兑水的酒、mulsum与树脂、双耳罐与dolia，以及老普林尼、加图、科卢梅拉和庞贝。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-nell-antica-roma.jpg?v=6d7a5a54" length="190482" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-nell-antica-roma.jpg?v=6d7a5a54" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>盒中袋葡萄酒能放多久？开封与未开封的保存期限</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.16/daizhuang-putaojiu-neng-fang-duojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.16/daizhuang-putaojiu-neng-fang-duojiu/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>开封的盒中袋能放多久，未开封的又能放多久；为什么它比开了的瓶装酒撑得久，应该怎样存放，盒装酒是否真的更差。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/bag-in-box-quanto-dura.jpg?v=e963db1e" length="204032" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/bag-in-box-quanto-dura.jpg?v=e963db1e" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>三文鱼配什么酒？从节日小点到烧烤</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.15/sanwenyu-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.15/sanwenyu-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>烟熏、生食、烤箱或烧烤：四种三文鱼，四款酒，从传统法起泡酒到Pinot nero，不必畏惧红酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-il-salmone.jpg?v=54bc2604" length="230002" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-il-salmone.jpg?v=54bc2604" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>博格利与超级托斯卡纳：当葡萄酒战胜了官僚体制</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.15/bolgheri-yu-chaoji-tuosikana-putaojiu-zhansheng-guanliao/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.15/bolgheri-yu-chaoji-tuosikana-putaojiu-zhansheng-guanliao/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>从不合规矩的餐酒，到Bolgheri DOC和独立的Sassicaia DOC：超级托斯卡纳与托斯卡纳海岸赤霞珠的故事。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/bolgheri-e-i-supertuscan.jpg?v=98ddd21f" length="289913" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/bolgheri-e-i-supertuscan.jpg?v=98ddd21f" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>意大利伟大的甜酒：从阿尔卑斯到岛屿的一张地图</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/yidali-tianjiu-zhinan-ditu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/yidali-tianjiu-zhinan-ditu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>风干、贵腐、晚收与加强酒：一份从北到南的意大利甜酒指南，从Recioto一直走到Moscato di Noto。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vini-dolci-italiani.jpg?v=6a391e49" length="383609" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vini-dolci-italiani.jpg?v=6a391e49" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Oltrepò Pavese：米兰视而不见的葡萄园</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/oltrepo-pavese-milan-putaoyuan-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/oltrepo-pavese-milan-putaoyuan-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>米兰以南是伦巴第最大的葡萄园，出产Bonarda、Buttafuoco、Pinot Nero和气泡酒。为什么很少有人提起它，它又在如何改变。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/oltrepo-pavese-vigneto-di-milano.jpg?v=0f633010" length="280362" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/oltrepo-pavese-vigneto-di-milano.jpg?v=0f633010" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>茄子帕尔玛焗（parmigiana）配什么酒：油炸、烤制还是清淡版</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/qiezi-parmigiana-pei-shenme-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.14/qiezi-parmigiana-pei-shenme-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>番茄、油炸、拉丝奶酪和罗勒：茄子帕尔玛焗该配什么葡萄酒，从格拉尼亚诺到弗莱帕托，以及哪些酒最好避开。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-la-parmigiana-di-melanzane.jpg?v=540b9976" length="387781" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-la-parmigiana-di-melanzane.jpg?v=540b9976" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>巧克力配什么酒？餐桌上最不友好的搭配</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.13/qiaokeli-pei-shenme-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.13/qiaokeli-pei-shenme-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>黑巧、牛奶还是白巧？为什么巧克力几乎让所有酒陷入危机，以及从波特酒、Banyuls到Barolo Chinato，哪几类能扛住冲击。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-e-cioccolato.jpg?v=f6876664" length="119564" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-e-cioccolato.jpg?v=f6876664" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Lessini Durello：诞生于玄武岩与酸度的起泡酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.13/lessini-durello-huoshan-qipaojiu/</link><guid i