jiu-caishou-haiba/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>采收提前、海拔一千米的葡萄园、英国起泡酒与PIWI抗病品种。气候变化正在如何改写葡萄酒的地理与风格。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cambiamento-climatico-e-vino.jpg?v=073c3507" length="334065" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cambiamento-climatico-e-vino.jpg?v=073c3507" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Valpolicella：四款酒（外加一款）的山谷，从Classico到Amarone</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.01/valpolicella-sikuan-jiu-de-shangu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.01/valpolicella-sikuan-jiu-de-shangu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Classico、Superiore、Ripasso、Amarone与Recioto：Valpolicella这个酒的家族如何运转，说说marogne石墙、Corvina，以及值得重新发现的日常红酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/valpolicella-la-valle-dei-quattro-vini.jpg?v=7e014d9f" length="357115" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/valpolicella-la-valle-dei-quattro-vini.jpg?v=7e014d9f" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Fiano与Greco：向时间挑战的伊尔皮尼亚白葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.01/fiano-greco-yierpinia-baijiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.01/fiano-greco-yierpinia-baijiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Fiano di Avellino与Greco di Tufo，伊尔皮尼亚那些越陈越好的白酒。土壤、海拔、硫磺，以及一场几乎出人意料的复兴。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/fiano-e-greco-bianchi-irpinia.jpg?v=5bd0b5d7" length="257594" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/fiano-e-greco-bianchi-irpinia.jpg?v=5bd0b5d7" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>辣菜配什么酒？糖分、酸度与低酒精</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.31/lacai-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.31/lacai-pei-shenme-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>咖喱、冬阴功、四川麻辣与&#x27;nduja。为什么酒精和单宁会助长灼烧感，哪些酒真正能压住它，从Riesling到桃红酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-cucina-piccante.jpg?v=fb317ce3" length="268426" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vino-con-cucina-piccante.jpg?v=fb317ce3" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Grillo、Catarratto、Inzolia、Carricante：西西里的白葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.31/xixili-baipu-tao-grillo-catarratto/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.31/xixili-baipu-tao-grillo-catarratto/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>四种白葡萄，带你认识Marsala与埃特纳之外的西西里：盐田、海风，以及在这样炎热的岛上很少有人料到的酸度。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/grillo-catarratto-bianchi-siciliani.jpg?v=dffb1f92" length="207534" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/grillo-catarratto-bianchi-siciliani.jpg?v=dffb1f92" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>没有开瓶器怎么办？不受伤也能开酒的方法</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.30/meiyou-kaipingqi-zenme-kai-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.30/meiyou-kaipingqi-zenme-kai-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>侍酒</category><description>把软木塞推进瓶里，用螺丝和钳子，或者拿鞋子撞墙：哪些办法管用，哪些千万别试，外加一段开瓶器的小历史。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/aprire-vino-senza-cavatappi.jpg?v=bb3e03b6" length="376075" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/aprire-vino-senza-cavatappi.jpg?v=bb3e03b6" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item></channel></rss>
